#: src/components/landing/LanguagesView.tsx
msgid "Lymi schedules reviews with FSRS, an algorithm Anki also offers, so the timing will feel familiar. What changes is the work around it: a card takes seconds to add, and your assistant can add a whole lesson. There is no Anki import yet."
